{{!-- Single tag chip. Expects context to be a tag record from tags.yaml
      (label, slug). Used inline in paper cards + paper detail.

      Anchor stops propagation so clicks on chips inside a
      card-wrapping anchor don't also trigger the outer link. --}}
<a href="/tags/{{slug}}/"
   onclick="event.stopPropagation();"
   class="tag-chip">{{label}}</a>
